gitzipinline <p>Fetch the bundle directly from a pinned tree in a GitHub repository. <code>path</code> selects the file within <code>repo@ref</code>.</p> <pre><code>"distribution": {
  "kind": "git",
  "repository": "https://github.com/Vineyard-Intelligence/cidr-expand",
  "ref": "4d2f8b19c0a7e6f3b1d5a4c9e8f70123456789ab",
  "path": "manifest.json",
  "integrity": { "algo": "sha256", "hash": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb924..." }
}
</code></pre> <p>Fetch a prebuilt archive (typically a GitHub release asset) named by <code>archive.url</code>. <code>archive.sha256</code> is required whenever <code>archive</code> is present.</p> <pre><code>"distribution": {
  "kind": "zip",
  "repository": "https://github.com/Vineyard-Intelligence/chaos-pack",
  "ref": "v1.2.0",
  "archive": {
    "url": "https://github.com/Vineyard-Intelligence/chaos-pack/releases/download/v1.2.0/chaos-pack.zip",
    "sha256": "9b74c9897bac770ffc029102a200c5de..."
  }
}
</code></pre> <p><code>inline</code> is an accepted <code>kind</code> in the schema, but the app cannot run it. A plugin whose <code>platforms.web.entry</code> is <code>inline</code> (or missing), with no pack-level entry to inherit, is not listed as runnable.</p> <pre><code>"distribution": {
  "kind": "inline",
  "integrity": { "algo": "sha256", "hash": "..." }
}
</code></pre>

gitzipinline <p>GitHub 저장소의 고정된 트리에서 직접 번들을 가져옵니다. <code>path</code>는 <code>repo@ref</code> 내의 파일을 선택합니다.</p> <pre><code>"distribution": {
  "kind": "git",
  "repository": "https://github.com/Vineyard-Intelligence/cidr-expand",
  "ref": "4d2f8b19c0a7e6f3b1d5a4c9e8f70123456789ab",
  "path": "manifest.json",
  "integrity": { "algo": "sha256", "hash": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb924..." }
}
</code></pre> <p><code>archive.url</code>로 지정된 미리 빌드된 아카이브(일반적으로 GitHub 릴리스 자산)를 가져옵니다. <code>archive</code>가 있으면 <code>archive.sha256</code>은 필수입니다.</p> <pre><code>"distribution": {
  "kind": "zip",
  "repository": "https://github.com/Vineyard-Intelligence/chaos-pack",
  "ref": "v1.2.0",
  "archive": {
    "url": "https://github.com/Vineyard-Intelligence/chaos-pack/releases/download/v1.2.0/chaos-pack.zip",
    "sha256": "9b74c9897bac770ffc029102a200c5de..."
  }
}
</code></pre> <p><code>inline</code>은 스키마상 허용되는 <code>kind</code>이지만, 앱은 이를 실행할 수 없습니다. <code>platforms.web.entry</code>가 <code>inline</code>이거나 없고 상속받을 팩 수준 entry도 없는 플러그인은 실행 가능 목록에 나타나지 않습니다.</p> <pre><code>"distribution": {
  "kind": "inline",
  "integrity": { "algo": "sha256", "hash": "..." }
}
</code></pre>
